# =============================================================================
# terraform.tfvars.example: nothing to set by hand
# =============================================================================
# Every fact of the environment (subscriptions, management groups, names, networks,
# NSGs, addresses, VMs, Key Vaults, the monitoring workspace, the notification
# addresses, the policy assignments) comes from infrastructure.yml. Write it with:
#
#   pwsh config/variables/scripts/New-IacVariableFiles.ps1 `
#       -InfrastructureFile ./infrastructure.yml -OutputDirectory <folder outside the repository>
#
# That writes terraform/azure-local/terraform.tfvars.json and backend.hcl. Keep
# the folder out of git: the file holds subscription IDs and names.
#
#   terraform init -backend-config=backend.hcl
#   terraform plan -var-file=terraform.tfvars.json -out=tfplan
#
# Do not put a value of the environment in a .tfvars file: a later -var-file wins
# over terraform.tfvars.json, so it would override infrastructure.yml. A variable
# with a default is a setting of this code (class c, with its default, under
# tools.terraform.variables in config/variables/schema/master-registry.yaml).
# Where the values that people ask about come from:
#   nsgs                       landing_zone.network_security_groups[]
#   key_vault_allowed_ips      key_vaults[purpose=management].allowed_ip_ranges
#   spn_resource_group_roles   azure.automation_identity.resource_group_roles[]
#   policy_assignments         landing_zone.policy.assignments[]
#   rg_policy_assignments      landing_zone.policy.resource_group_assignments[]
#   log_analytics_sku          a setting of the code (PerGB2018, the pay-as-you-go pricing tier)
#
# Secrets are never in a file. Pass them in the environment:
#   TF_VAR_vm_admin_password   the reference is landing_zone.virtual_machines[].admin_password
#   TF_VAR_vpn_shared_key      the reference is landing_zone.connectivity.vpn_gateway.site_to_site[].shared_key
# =============================================================================
